  "title": "· New Bag · BVLGARI’s Fall/Winter 2026 Collection: Inspired by Tubogas Craftsmanship",
  "original_title": "新包 | BVLGARI 即将发售2026秋冬系列手袋：Tubogas 工艺灵感",
  "excerpt": "Bulgari's 2026 Fall/Winter collection debuts in August, featuring Tubogas-inspired handbags with sculptural jewelry handles.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-07-07",
  "date_label": "July 07, 2026",
