      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "BVLGARI is set to launch its 2026 Fall/Winter handbag and accessory collection starting in August. The new**Tubogas**line draws inspiration from the brand's iconic Tubogas jewelry chains, featuring sculptural handles crafted from brass, enamel, mother-of-pearl, and crystal. These are paired with leather, velvet, or satin bodies, extending the brand's jewelry aesthetic into everyday bags.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/84m8dx5/fc671c701c44e4f1.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/84m8dx5/80642ee81230ccef.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The**Tubogas**gold chain has been used in BVLGARI watch straps since the 1940s. Inspired by urban gas pipelines from the industrial era, it seamlessly aligns with the Serpenti motif, becoming one of the brand's most iconic designs.",
