    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Tubogas Sphere evening bag features a sleek rectangular silhouette with a Tubogas spiral handle. Two spherical elements serve as focal points, echoing the ball details found on 1970s Tubogas bracelets. One sphere is finished in translucent enamel, while the other is densely set with crystals on brass, radiating a dazzling, jewel-like brilliance.",
