    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Tubogas Parentesi Top Handle evening bag is crafted from black velvet and features an arched Tubogas spiral chain handle with a Parentesi arc-shaped lock. Inspired by the paving details of ancient Roman streets, the arc-shaped joint between stone bricks resembles the '(' symbol, giving the motif its name \"Parentesi\" — Italian for \"parenthesis.\" The design is highlighted with densely set crystals that enhance the metallic arcs, shimmering against the black velvet backdrop.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
