      "text": "The Tubogas Cabochon clutch focuses on the Tubogas jewelry handle. It is either paired with a Parentesi clasp set with crystals or adorned with cabochon-cut gemstones, mother-of-pearl, and crystal accents on the handle. The result is a richly layered luster, transforming jewelry aesthetics into refined and glamorous evening accessories.",
